# ufc3mons
===
 UFC3MONS is an experimental native Xbox 360 port of UFC Undisputed 3 built with RexGlue. The game boots and runs smoothly in menus, and a shader translation fix restores in-game shadows. Exhibition fights run, but currently suffer from severe slow motion; performance optimization is the next focus.
